			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3673637">
									

<p>Argentinian here! I was going to ask you if Agent Santos was a reference to the Argentine show &quot;Los Simuladores&quot;, which would've been awesome, but I guess it was just a serendipity. Very well done!<br />
What I'm not sure if you'd really need to fly to Buenos Aires from Santa Cruz just for a head injury, given that there are mayor cities closer (Río Gallegos and Comodoro Rivadavia would be better options), but I also understand the need of dropping a big city name to make people understand the geographical context.<br />
I would've like to see a real city being used as an SCP (the real Cameron is a ranch) just to make it more realistic, but I'm just being nitpicky.</p>

